"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, portal2.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The Portal2ArchipelagoMod folder will be installed into steamapps\\sourcemods. After Steam restarted, there should be a new game in the Library called 'Portal 2 Archipelago Mod'.",
