"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"Portal 2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'portal2.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, (re)start the Archipelago Launcher and look for the 'Portal 2 Client'.\n\nOnce the Portal 2 Text Client is open, in the top text field type 'archipelago:XXXXX' where XXXXX is the port, you can find this 5-digit number on the Archipelago website after opening a new room.\n\nFinally, click 'Connect' and then go back to the game and you can start playing!",
"kill",
